{"1522930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Transiruby", "steam_appid": 1522930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1823420], "detailed_description": "<h1>Other SKIPMORE's Title</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Explore the mysteries of an unknown land!<br>&quot;Transiruby&quot; is a metroidvania game where you explore the world as a cyborg protagonist named Siruby. Slash and shoot your way to reveal its hidden secrets!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522930/extras/7cec2e19b209138335ccffbb7479eec6.avif?t=1725004048\" width=620 height=192 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Story]</h2>A strange continent from a different dimension has suddenly appeared… and Siruby, a young cyborg traveling space just happens to pass by. Taking her trusty AI partner “Ne-com” with her, she sets out to explore this unknown land.<br><br>Meet other characters such as “Yamato”, an unusual cyborg girl and “Douglas” the treasure hunter as you follow Siruby through her adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522930/extras/1da7e04b21bf6d317dda9f5eb9b849c5.avif?t=1725004048\" width=600 height=156 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522930/extras/37b335219261599027f6f91ab50424bb.poster.avif?t=1725004048\" width=620 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522930/extras/37b335219261599027f6f91ab50424bb.webm?t=1725004048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522930/extras/37b335219261599027f6f91ab50424bb.mp4?t=1725004048\" type=\"video/mp4\